    "detailed_description": "<h1>GAMES FROM FRIENDS</h1><p>",
    "about_the_game": "The Coffee Queen is missing! The islanders seem to have forgotten her presence. You, the niece of the Coffee Queen need to <strong>uncover special recipes, brew drinks, serve them and transport islanders to their destinations</strong> to gather pieces of her memory. Only then can the Brewed Horizons can go back to its time of peace and quiet!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911630/extras/6c1898fc6d4e0d914bff08061d983a35.poster.avif?t=1739790351\" width=800 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911630/extras/6c1898fc6d4e0d914bff08061d983a35.webm?t=1739790351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911630/extras/6c1898fc6d4e0d914bff08061d983a35.mp4?t=1739790351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Brewed Horizons</h2>Explore and travel between the islands, collecting items and passengers!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83d\udc51 Use the Queen\u2019s old boat to travel between archipelagos.<br></li><li> \ud83d\udea2 Upgrade the boat with new sails, stronger hulls, and magical enhancements to overcome natural and supernatural obstacles.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Special Beverages</h2>Wait! The islanders need to remember the Coffee Queen to reunite. Trigger key memories related to the Queen, and maybe even discover her disappearance.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Collect unique ingredients from each archipelago.<br></li><li> \ud83c\udf79 Craft special beverages that trigger memories of the Coffee Queen and restore unity among the islanders.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat Monsters</h2>The disappearance of the Queen has spawned monsters in the sea!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \u2694\ufe0f Use crafted items creatively to defeat the monsters.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish and Decorate</h2>Ensure the comfort of the islanders, of course.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83e\ude91 Create safe and familiar environments for passengers according to their preferences.</li></ul><br>The fate of the Brewed Horizons lies in your hands. Are you ready to rise to the challenge and restore the kingdom to its former glory?",
    "short_description": "Design your boat, tailor a drink menu fit for royalty and serve drinks while navigating through the kingdom. Explore the high seas with your boat! The islanders need a ferry, and he kingdom needs you to uncover the mystery of the Coffee Queen's disappearance!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Greek, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
